
> asscrack@0.6.0 test
> node --test

✔ main.js forwards the history event (11.899364ms)
✔ preload.cjs exposes onHistory (0.6665ms)
✔ renderer.js listens for history (0.937808ms)
✔ main.js writes a log file with the window console (1.150989ms)
✔ main.js forwards the topology event (1.341864ms)
✔ preload.cjs exposes onTopology and getTopology (1.110613ms)
✔ main.js logs the direction, the cancel side and the file actions (1.074183ms)
✔ preload.cjs passes a peer ID in cancelFile (0.593018ms)
✔ preload.cjs exposes revealFile by key and no path API for the reveal (1.254162ms)
✔ main.js records the receive path of file-done by offerId|peerId and checks that the file exists (1.054081ms)
✔ renderer.js has one Escape dispatcher in the sequence menu, layout, invite panel, map (2.580529ms)
✔ menu.js handles no Escape itself (0.665758ms)
✔ the row buttons and the menus call the same action functions (1.012136ms)
✔ nodemap.js highlights a node by peer ID with a data attribute (0.923086ms)
✔ menu.js, renderer.js and nodemap.js set no inline style (2.567145ms)
✔ menu.js loads with no DOM and gives menuCore only (2.163523ms)
✔ menuCore.actionsFor gives the actions of each target (2.584722ms)
✔ menuCore.allowed stops a stale action after the transfer completed (1.215529ms)
✔ menuCore keys and position (2.373554ms)
✔ the Escape dispatcher closes the find bar and then the quote chip, between layout and the invite panel (0.710258ms)
✔ find.js and quote.js handle no Escape and set no inline style (1.119341ms)
✔ the Quote button and the menu action Quote run the same row action (0.778171ms)
✔ index.html loads find.js and quote.js before renderer.js, and has the find bar and the quote chip (0.772824ms)
✔ menuCore gives Quote for a quotable message line (2.066537ms)
✔ one duplex stream carries chat both ways and cleans up on disconnect (1210.007465ms)
